			"notes": "- Fixed defeated Pokémon leaving stale base-drop data behind.\n- More directly determines why something's dropping instead of guessing after.\n- Fixed up sound playing for Ticked dropper.\n- Brought Killed dropper up to parity with vanilla context params and cleaned up references.\n- **A breaking change was introduced.** Make sure to update your Pasture Collector and other dependents when a compatible version is released.\n\n- Pulled the mod icon in.\n- Marked Counter as an optional dependency.\n\n- Added redundant dev-only access transformer mimicking Cobblemon's, which should fix dev environment issues with NF builds."
		},
